Given this, I will write the test by defining a minimal interface IJellyfinDatabaseProvider in the test namespace to simulate the dependency and verify the call to GetRequiredService and RunShutdownTask. This will allow compilation and testing of the call to GetRequiredService on IServiceProvider.

